    "body_paragraphs": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "Your role as an LTC agent is to help consumers understand their options and the rules that apply to those options. That includes explaining eligibility for private LTC coverage and, when relevant, Medicaid. You also need to make sure the client receives the Shopper’s Guide when required. This matters because many consumers do not know how to compare policies or recognize the tradeoffs in cost, benefits, and future value. Your advice can affect whether a policy still works years later, not just whether it looks affordable today."
